    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leisurely, tardy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς.
				κομισθῆναι</span> to go <i>leisurely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ποιεῖν τὴν πορείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.1.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολαίτεραι ἀπαλλαγαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Dieb.Judic.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.603e
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.5.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1171b24
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολαίτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.47
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				610d
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίτατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.3.6
				</span></i>
			; but also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχολαιότερον,
			-ότατα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.5.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lac.</u>
				11.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.391
			</span></i> (Adj.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Ther.Praef.</u>
				</span></i>
			</div>
